{
  "name": "@macts-e2e/mcp-contracts",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "MCP contract-tools integration: serves the real Notes and Calendar contracts through the @macts/mcp adapter, a real runtime, and a real MCP client and server, and checks tool derivation, dispatch, and the structured error shape; also checks every shipped contract's embedded input JSON Schema and that discovery and the adapter agree on every tool name, that no contract client has a method for an unavailable operation, and that no output reference names a resource a reference read from the app could not resolve",
